# Per-machine hardware config: serial numbers, tubing volumes and reagent port
# names are specific to one rig, and gui.py loads ./config.yaml automatically,
# so a committed copy would silently override every other machine's setup.
# Covers the legacy .json (auto-converted on load) and the per-rig copies kept
# side by side when more than one instrument is in play. Shareable examples
# belong in software/sample_config/.
software/config*.yaml
software/config*.json
software/_config*.yaml
# Local test sequence, swept in by a directory-wide git add. Belongs to the
# temperature-controller work, not here; add it deliberately if it should ship.
software/sample_sequences/temperature-test.yaml

# Design docs and plans live in the AI-docs repo, not here.
docs/superpowers/
